title Vinyl: Now playing's transition chip at 640x480 (9.01 px/mm): Crossfade 20 sec beside the format chip on one row; "Crossfade 20 s" does not fit there beside a long format ("WAV 44.1 kHz / 16"), so the chip reads "Fade 20 s" (shortened only when the whole text would not fit)
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_TRANSITION crossfade_20

wait 1200
shot 01-now-crossfade-20
expect text "Fade 20 s"
expect notext "Gapless"
expect notext "Crossfade 20 s"
expect noquit
